Title: Gary Becker’sContribution to the Economics of Matching and Marriage
Abstract: In his seminal, 1973 paper, published in the Journal of Political Economy, Gary Becker emphasizes marriage as a crucial, yet understudied issue to which economic analysis could, therefore should, be applied.
