Title: Transformation of African Farm Households: A Short Survey of Economic Contributions
Abstract: This paper reviews the scant economic literature on the transformations of farming households under the influence of land pressure, market development or technical change. Theoretical as well as empirical contributions are summarized with a special attention to the African context.
Keywords: Africa, Family transformation
