Title: Foreword/Editorial Introduction
Abstract: This special issue of the Journal of Demographic Economics (JODE) on “Migration and Development” follows the 15th AFD-World Bank Migration and Development Conference that took place at the NOVA School of Business and Economics, Lisbon, in September 2022. The conference is part of an annual series that started in 2008 and takes place each year at a different location.
